    "faq_U7EXL8": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_fzMaty": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I know this collectible is authentic?",
            "answer": "<p>Every LEGXI Limited Edition Arshdeep Singh Signed Ball is 100% authentic. LEGXI is a certified collectible brand, co-invested by Indian cricketer Arshdeep Singh himself - ensuring credibility and trust. Each ball is personally hand-signed by Arshdeep Singh and comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, verifying its signature, edition number, and collectible value.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_zn6QHg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the frame and wooden base included?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Every collectible comes encased in a crystal-clear museum-grade glass frame and poised on a premium hand-finished wooden base, designed to preserve and showcase your collectible with distinction.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_MHCCNJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I receive my collectible?",
            "answer": "<p>Once you secure your collectible, same will be delivered within 7–10 business days in premium LEGXI packaging, complete with authentication and presentation materials.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_bc4eUW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I get unique number?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, you can claim a unique edition number for your collectible. Each LEGXI piece is part of a numbered limited edition series, ensuring authenticity and exclusivity.While edition numbers are not assigned on a first-come basis, our expert team will personally connect with you after registration to explain the selection process and assist you in securing your own personal edition number. Once claimed, that number becomes exclusively yours- forever<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        }
      },
